## 1. Parties

This agreement is between **[PUBLISHER_NAME]**, of [PUBLISHER_ADDRESS] ("we",
"us"), and you, the person or organisation that obtained a licence to
[PRODUCT_NAME] ("you").

By installing or using [PRODUCT_NAME] you accept this agreement. If you do not
accept it, do not install it, and request a refund under section 9.

## 2. What you are buying

A licence to use [PRODUCT_NAME]. You are not buying the software itself. We keep
ownership of [PRODUCT_NAME] and of every copy of it, including all intellectual
property rights in it.

## 3. What you may do

Subject to payment and to the rest of this agreement, we grant you a
non-exclusive, non-transferable, worldwide licence to:

- **Install and use** [PRODUCT_NAME] on up to [SEAT_COUNT] computers that you
  own or control, and that are used by [SEAT_HOLDER].
- **Use it for commercial work.** Artwork, grids, layouts and files you produce
  with [PRODUCT_NAME] are yours. We claim no rights in them, and you owe us
  nothing further for them: no royalties, no attribution, no per-project fee.
- **Keep backup copies** of the installation file for your own use.

## 4. What you may not do

You may not:

- Sell, rent, lend, sublicense, publish, share, or otherwise distribute
  [PRODUCT_NAME] or its installation file (`.zxp`), in whole or in part,
  including inside a template, course, bundle, or asset pack.
- Use one licence across more computers or people than section 3 allows, or
  share your download link or licence details.
- Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble [PRODUCT_NAME], or attempt to
  derive its source code, except to the extent that this restriction is
  prohibited by law in [JURISDICTION].
- Modify [PRODUCT_NAME], or create derivative works from it, and distribute the
  result.
- Remove, obscure or alter any copyright, trademark or licence notice in
  [PRODUCT_NAME], including the notices in the `NOTICE` file.
- Use [PRODUCT_NAME] to build a product that competes with it.

Using [PRODUCT_NAME] outside this licence is copyright infringement as well as a
breach of this agreement.

## 5. Transfers

This licence is personal to you. You may not transfer it to anyone else without
our written agreement. If you bought it as an organisation, you may reassign it
between your own staff, provided only [SEAT_COUNT] installations are in use at
any time.

## 6. Third-party software

[PRODUCT_NAME] includes third-party components listed in the `NOTICE` file
