[PRODUCT_NAME] is an independent product. It is not made, endorsed, supported or
certified by Adobe. Adobe, Illustrator and InDesign are trademarks of Adobe Inc.
You need your own licensed copy of Adobe Illustrator or Adobe InDesign to use
[PRODUCT_NAME].

## 7. Updates

We may, but need not, release updates. Unless we say otherwise at the time of
