## 11. No warranty

To the fullest extent permitted by law, [PRODUCT_NAME] is provided **"as is"**
and **"as available"**, without warranty of any kind, express or implied,
including any implied warranty of merchantability, fitness for a particular
purpose, accuracy, or non-infringement.

We do not warrant that [PRODUCT_NAME] will be uninterrupted or error-free, that
it will work with every version of Illustrator or InDesign, or that any defect
will be corrected.

**Keep backups.** [PRODUCT_NAME] draws into and deletes from your documents at
your instruction. Save your work before using it, and keep backups of any file
that matters.

Some jurisdictions do not allow the exclusion of implied warranties, so parts of
this section may not apply to you. Consumers may have statutory rights that this
agreement cannot limit.

## 12. Limitation of liability

To the fullest extent permitted by law:

- We are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or
