## 13. Termination

This licence ends automatically if you materially breach it, in particular
section 4. On termination you must stop using [PRODUCT_NAME] and delete every
copy. Sections 2, 4, 11, 12 and 14 survive termination.

You may end this licence at any time by deleting every copy. Ending it does not
by itself entitle you to a refund.

